ram with based on performance evaluation PPO is strategically designed to provide immersive hands-on experience while fostering comprehensive professional development. Candidates are permitted to apply for only one role.&#10;</div><div>Internship Job Description (JD)&#10;</div><div>&#8226;&#9;Position: Graduate Engineering Intern (B.Tech/M.Tech) 2027&#10;</div><div>&#8226;&#9;Organization: Unistring Tech Solutions Pvt. Ltd. (UTS)&#10;</div><div>&#8226;&#9;Position: Research Intern &#10;</div><div>&#8226;&#9;Duration: 12 months &#10;</div><div>&#8226;&#9;Stipend: &#8377;40,000&#8211;&#8377;50,000 per month &#10;</div><div>&#8226;&#9;Work Schedule: 6 days a week &#10;</div><div>&#8226;&#9;Timings: 9:00 AM &#8211; 6:30 PM &#10;</div><div>&#8226;&#9;Work Location: Hyderabad and client locations &#10;</div><div>&#8226;&#9;UTS Work Mode: Offline&#10;</div><div>Selection Process:&#10;</div><div>&#8226;&#9;IQ Test. &#10;</div><div>&#8226;&#9;Domain Test. &#10;</div><div>&#8226;&#9;Two Technical round Interviews. &#10;</div><div>&#8226;&#9;HR Offer Discussion. &#10;</div><div>Eligibility Criteria&#10;</div><div>B.Tech/M.Tech students (final year or eligible for long-term internship)&#10;</div><div>Disciplines: ECE, EEE, CSE, Mechanical (relevant roles based on domain)&#10;</div><div>Strong fundamentals in core engineering subjects&#10;</div><div>Interest in defence systems, RF technologies, embedded systems, or system integration&#10;</div><div>Stipend Disbursement Structure:&#10;</div><div>First 3 months: 50% of stipend will be paid.&#10;</div><div>Remaining stipend will be released after successful completion of 12 months internship.&#10;</div><div>Pre-Placement Offer (PPO)&#10;</div><div>PPO will be offered based on performance evaluation during the internship (8 to 12 LPA)&#10;</div><div>Leave &amp; Academic Policy&#10;</div><div>Academic Leaves:&#10;</div><div>Granted for examinations and academic project requirements with prior communication from the institute (treated as approved leave)&#10;</div><div>Monthly Leave:&#10;</div><div>1 leave per month is permitted&#10;</div><div>Additional Leaves: Will be treated as Loss of Pay (LOP)</div><div>&#10;</div><div>&#10;</div><div>&#10;</div><div>&#10;</div><div>&#10;</div><div>&#10;</div><div>&#10;</div>","additional_details":"Research Intern &#8211; Hardware (ECE/EEE) &#10;<div>Research Intern &#8211; VLSI (ECE/EEE) &#10;</div><div>Research Intern &#8211; Software (CSE/ECE) &#10;</div><div>Research Intern &#8211; AI/ML (AI/ML)&#10;</div><div>Research Intern &#8211; Signal Processing (ECE/EEE) &#10;</div><div>Research Intern &#8211; DSP Radar Engineer (EEE/ECE) &#10;</div><div>Research Intern &#8211; UAV Engineer (Aerospace Engineering/ECE)&#10;</div><div>Research Intern &#8211; Antenna Design Engineer (EEE/ECE)&#10;</div><div>Research Intern &#8211; Software Quality Audit (SQA) Engineer ECE/CSE)</div>","is_notification_muted":true,"is_withdrawal_same_as_application_deadline":false,"is_new_company":false,"is_display_name_same_as_company_name":true,"is_included_in_application_matrix":false,"display_name":"Unistring Tech Solutions Pvt.","is_published":true,"is_deleted":false,"is_process_completed":false,"created_by":10905,"created_by_name":"Rajasekhar Reddy","updated_by":10658,"created_at":1776944975000,"updated_at":1777553948000,"company_query":{"overview":null,"city":null,"state":null,"zip":null,"pan":null,"contacts":null,"sourceHistory":null,"placecoms":null,"approved":false,"company_id":1740,"company_name":"Unistring Tech Solutions Pvt.","source":"Existing Database","website_url":null,"logo":null,"industry":null,"address_line_1":null,"address_line_2":null,"is_approved":false,"is_disabled":false,"primary_placecoms":null,"secondary_placecoms":null,"created_by":8524,"updated_by":8524,"created_at":1776943634000,"updated_at":1776943634000},"questions":[],"documents":[{"documentName":null,"jd_document_id":1094,"application_id":1253,"document_id":19012,"user_id":10905,"document_type_id":5,"u